<title>USA: Deere cap arm issues $200 mln notes due '99.</title>
<headline>Deere cap arm issues $200 mln notes due '99.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from John Deere Capital Corp was priced Friday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>John Deere Capital, a unit of Deere &amp; Co, provides financing for retail purchases of new and used John Deere agricultural, industrial, commercial and consumer equipment.</p>
<p>BORROWER JOHN DEERE CAPITAL</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.00 PCT   MATURITY 2/1/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.981  FIRST PAY DATE 8/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.013 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 23 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
